agent_answer:
For undergraduate students, you are considered scholastically deficient and may be placed on scholastic probation if:

* Your semester grade point average is less than 2.00 (student-rules:rule12:1);
* Your cumulative grade point average is less than 2.00 (student-rules:rule12:1);
* Your cumulative GPA in your major field of study is below 2.00 (student-rules:rule12:1); or
* You are not meeting college and/or major course of study GPA requirements (student-rules:rule12:1).
